# collimator_export.mac
# Batch-only export of the collimator concept geometry: two 1 m^2 silicon planes 10 cm apart,
# with a 49%-open-area HDPE collimator (13x13 holes, 54 mm hole / 23 mm wall, 107 cm
# deep) immediately upstream of the first plane. No uranium, no beam, no field -- this
# macro only draws the geometry and writes it to a VRML file for offline viewing.
# Deliberately named without "vis" so MAIN.cc routes it to plain batch execution instead
# of the interactive Qt session.
/vis/open VRML2FILE
/vis/viewer/set/style surface
/vis/viewer/set/auxiliaryEdge true
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/flush
